        "original_id": "09969ffc-088c-5c8b-a2fb-6952d431f4ff",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: French Bulldog, American Bulldog\n- People: Brigitte\n- Places: England, Paris, France\n- Roles: dog actress\n- Systems: ABC, Modern Family\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1800s, French Bulldogs resulted from a cross between bulldog ancestors imported from England and local ratters in Paris, France.\n- Brigitte was born in 2010.\n- Brigitte is a French Bulldog dog actress.\n- Brigitte is best known for playing Stella in the ABC television series \"Modern Family\".\n- The French Bulldog, also known as the Frenchie, is a small breed of domestic dog.\n- The American Bulldog is a breed of utility dog.\n- American Bulldogs have two specific types, Standard and Classic, and also include mixes of the two types.",
